DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
13212::$$$message_0107_0000_0000$$$::I'll try walking over the big bridge for a leisurely stroll.[lr]::
13213::$$$message_0107_0000_0001$$$::The skies are clear.[lr]::
13214::$$$message_0107_0000_0002$$$::The sunlight is slightly warm, and the ocean breeze cools my cheeks down a good amount.[lr]::
13215::$$$message_0107_0000_0003$$$::Saturday, the first day of the three-day weekend, is the perfect day for a picnic.::
13216::$$$message_0107_0001_0000$$$::"Oh, it's lively over there."[lr]::
13217::$$$message_0107_0001_0001$$$::There are kids at the park.[lr]::
13218::$$$message_0107_0001_0002$$$::There's quite a lot of them. They seem to be split into two teams fighting against each other, bringing in so much equipment that can't be used up in a day, like bats or soccer balls.::
13219::$$$message_0107_0002_0000$$$::I feel like sunbathing, and watch the big battle of the park while leaning on the handrail of the bridge.[lr]::
13220::$$$message_0107_0002_0001$$$::After many twists and turns, it seems like they have decided on basketball for the morning match. Each team picks their best players, and a good match of kids that can't be underestimated begins.[lr]::
13221::$$$message_0107_0002_0002$$$::Cheering, spurring, stirring, sighing.[lr]::
13222::$$$message_0107_0002_0003$$$::There are several people sitting on the grass in the park, being happy and sad with the children. It seems like I'm not the only spectator.::
13223::$$$message_0107_0003_0000$$$::"...Oh, hm."[lr]::
13224::$$$message_0107_0003_0001$$$::Even though I'm a bit on the alert because of the Holy Grail War incident and stuff, it's not bad to spend time like this too.[lr]::
13225::$$$message_0107_0003_0002$$$::I think time that's not especially fun but not boring is not something that you can get even if you try.::
13226::$$$message_0107_0004_0000$$$::I hear an especially loud cheer from the park.[lr]::
13227::$$$message_0107_0004_0001$$$::The match is over. It was a tense game, but the ones who took control of the game weren't the tall trio of elementary schoolers, but a normally formulated team.::
13228::$$$message_0107_0005_0000$$$::"I knew it. That boy was seizing control of the game more than ever."[lr]::
13229::$$$message_0107_0005_0001$$$::The players of the winning team were all average, but there was just one outstanding playmaker.[lr]::
13230::$$$message_0107_0005_0002$$$::The playmaker not only gave precise instructions to his teammates, but he was moving swiftly and shining as the ace player.[lr]::
13231::$$$message_0107_0005_0003$$$::On top of that, he must be a foreigner, as he has gorgeous blonde hair. It would be weird to not stand out.::
13232::$$$message_0107_0006_0000$$$::The blond playmaker must be the children's idol, as he's praising everyone's good fight with a smile. [lr]::
13233::$$$message_0107_0006_0001$$$::Being that skilled, it would be natural for him to become a braggart, but he is a very well-rounded boy.[lr]::
13234::$$$message_0107_0006_0002$$$::Then...::
13235::$$$message_0107_0007_0000$$$::"Huh?"[lr]::
13236::$$$message_0107_0007_0001$$$::I feel like I made eye contact with the blondie in the park.[lr]::
13237::$$$message_0107_0007_0002$$$::Putting aside me having good eyesight, I thought I was hallucinating our eyes meeting from that distance, but...[lr]::
13238::$$$message_0107_0007_0003$$$::"Oh, he's coming over here."[lr]::
13239::$$$message_0107_0007_0004$$$::The blondie greets the kids and then goes across the park in a straight line, and goes up the stairs connecting to the bridge.::
13240::$$$message_0107_0008_0000$$$::"Good morning!"[lr]::
13241::$$$message_0107_0008_0001$$$::"...Yes?"[lr]::
13242::$$$message_0107_0008_0002$$$::I can't help but give a stupid reply.::
13243::$$$message_0107_0009_0000$$$::"Oh? Is it already 'good afternoon' by this time? Then, I'll redo it.[lr]::
13244::$$$message_0107_0009_0001$$$::Hello, good afternoon, Mister!"[lr]::
13245::$$$message_0107_0009_0002$$$::"Oh, yeah. [wvl][shock vmax=40 time=500 count=1]Hello."[lr]::
13246::$$$message_0107_0009_0003$$$::I get lured and greet him back.[lr]::
13247::$$$message_0107_0009_0004$$$::The blondie smiles happily.::
13248::$$$message_0107_0010_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
13249::$$$message_0107_0010_0001$$$::Shoot.[lr]::
13250::$$$message_0107_0010_0002$$$::I really don't remember him.[lr]::
13251::$$$message_0107_0010_0003$$$::[font italic=true]I have no recollection of being greeted by some kid I don't know... And he even came all the way from the park to here... I'm sure I've met him somewhere.[font italic=false]::
13252::$$$message_0107_0011_0000$$$::"Ugh, I can't remember anything. Sorry, have we met before?"[lr]::
13253::$$$message_0107_0011_0001$$$::"Oh, do you not remember me?"[lr]::
13254::$$$message_0107_0011_0002$$$::The blondie is surprised.[lr]::
13255::$$$message_0107_0011_0003$$$::I feel a lot of guilt, but sadly, nothing comes to mind.::
13256::$$$message_0107_0012_0000$$$::"Hmm, I see. You seem thickheaded, so it can't be helped since it is sudden. But, we have met several times. Although it seems like my outfit was different that time." [lr]::
13257::$$$message_0107_0012_0001$$$::"Your outfit was different?"[lr]::
13258::$$$message_0107_0012_0002$$$::Well. Just because his outfit is different, there's no way I could forget a kid that has this distinctive...::
13259::$$$message_0107_0013_0000$$$::"Hmm, well I guess more like appearance than outfit. Well, when I say 'it seemed like,' I'm talking about myself.[lr]::
13260::$$$message_0107_0013_0001$$$::Like I'm the same, but there's not much in common."[lr]::
13261::$$$message_0107_0013_0002$$$::I understand him even less now.[lr]::
13262::$$$message_0107_0013_0003$$$::Blondie frowns, as if to say it can't be helped.::
13263::$$$message_0107_0014_0000$$$::"Then I'll give you a hint. I am probably who you hate the most.[lr]::
13264::$$$message_0107_0014_0001$$$::There's not many people you can think of when I say that, right? You have a normal amount of people you don't like, but there's not many people that you hate."::
13265::$$$message_0107_0015_0000$$$::There's no sarcasm in the boy's voice.[lr]::
13266::$$$message_0107_0015_0001$$$::He knows he's hated, yet he looks at me with an innocent smile.[lr]::
13267::$$$message_0107_0015_0002$$$::He stares straight at me with eyes as red as blood[line len=3]wait, hold on...[wm canskip=0][lr]::
13268::$$$message_0107_0015_0003$$$::If it's someone with red eyes and golden hair, I may or may not just think of one person.::
13269::$$$message_0107_0016_0000$$$::"...Oh."[lr]::
13270::$$$message_0107_0016_0001$$$::He has nothing to do with him.[lr]::
13271::$$$message_0107_0016_0002$$$::He has nothing to do with him, but I feel like this boy's appearance...or like, facial features remind me of him.::
13272::$$$message_0107_0017_0000$$$::"Wait, but[line len=3]could it be that he has a younger brother...?"[wm canskip=0][lr]::
13273::$$$message_0107_0017_0001$$$::"Unfortunately, I do not have any blood relatives. I've always wanted to have a sibling or a partner."[lr]::
13274::$$$message_0107_0017_0002$$$::An innocent, angel-like smile.::
13275::$$$message_0107_0018_0000$$$::"Oh, but do not worry. Saber is not my type yet.[lr]::
13276::$$$message_0107_0018_0001$$$::Well, I might actually fall for her if she defeats me now, but I don't see her as an object of courting interest."::
13277::$$$message_0107_0019_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
13278::$$$message_0107_0019_0001$$$::My head is throbbing like I'm dehydrated.[lr]::
13279::$$$message_0107_0019_0002$$$::Therefore...[lr]::
13280::$$$message_0107_0019_0003$$$::Could it be that this blondie is, um...::
13281::$$$message_0107_0020_0000$$$::"It is me. I heard,[lr]::
13282::$$$message_0107_0020_0001$$$::'This situation is equal to child's play. I can't put up with this.'[lr]::
13283::$$$message_0107_0020_0002$$$::It seems like I took rejuvenating medicine. Even though it's about myself, I don't get it myself."::
13284::$$$message_0107_0021_0000$$$::"...No way."[lr]::
13285::$$$message_0107_0021_0001$$$::There's no way. There's really no way. Even if it was some mistake, there's [font italic=true]seriously[font italic=false] no way.[lr]::
13286::$$$message_0107_0021_0002$$$::There's no way that he was such a good kid when he was little...!::
13287::$$$message_0107_0022_0000$$$::"You're so easy to read, Mister. Well, I asked all kinds of people, and they all had the same reaction, so I know that I'm the one at fault.[lr]::
13288::$$$message_0107_0022_0001$$$::...Geez, I wonder why I'd do so many things that people don't like."[lr]::
13289::$$$message_0107_0022_0002$$$::Blondie sighs like it's a complicated topic even though it's about himself, no, because it's about himself.::
13290::$$$message_0107_0023_0000$$$::"Oh, everyone is calling me.[lr]::
13291::$$$message_0107_0023_0001$$$::See you again, Mister. You shouldn't be doing anything too dangerous on your own, but hmm, [cacheimage storage=ギル子供01c(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=ギル子供01c(中)]maybe I should have you look around after all.[lr]::
13292::$$$message_0107_0023_0002$$$::If you do that, I'll be able to go back to normal."[lr]::
13293::$$$message_0107_0023_0003$$$::Blondie bows politely and tries to leave.::
13294::$$$message_0107_0024_0000$$$::"Hey[line len=3]wait, what does that mean?"[lr]::
13295::$$$message_0107_0024_0001$$$::"I'm sorry, I can't tell you. Master told me that I can't tell you the answer.[lr]::
13296::$$$message_0107_0024_0002$$$::You see, I have previous offenses. Lancer said to not cause any trouble until I die, yet I went to go see Saber.[lr]::
13297::$$$message_0107_0024_0003$$$::...I wonder why I did such things."::
13298::$$$message_0107_0025_0000$$$::"Wha..."[lr]::
13299::$$$message_0107_0025_0001$$$::That must be talking about how he stabbed Caster half a year ago in the Holy Grail War.[wm canskip=0][lr]::
13300::$$$message_0107_0025_0002$$$::But[line len=3]::
13301::$$$message_0107_0026_0000$$$::"Your Master... Kotomine is no longer here. This is for certain."[lr]::
13302::$$$message_0107_0026_0001$$$::Yes. Even if all the Servants have stayed, and there are some Masters that shouldn't exist anymore.[lr]::
13303::$$$message_0107_0026_0002$$$::Kirei Kotomine is definitely dead.::
13304::$$$message_0107_0027_0000$$$::"Yes, my Master is Kotomine.[lr]::
13305::$$$message_0107_0027_0001$$$::But, Kotomine is actually dead. He is no longer in this world.[lr]::
13306::$$$message_0107_0027_0002$$$::So, Kirei Kotomine has nothing to do with this situation. You should think of me as an outsider that doesn't have to do with this game. Yeah. I really have nothing to do with this incident."::
13307::$$$message_0107_0028_0000$$$::The blond boy runs down the stairs.[lr]::
13308::$$$message_0107_0028_0001$$$::The kids are happy about the idol's return.[lr]::
13309::$$$message_0107_0028_0002$$$::As I watch him dumbfounded, I just note that that kid is actually him.[lr]::
13310::$$$message_0107_0028_0003$$$::...Of course, although I'm the slightest bit unconvinced.::

